# Copy to `.env.test.local` (gitignored) and fill with your LOCAL Supabase keys.
# Get them from: `npx supabase status` (ANON_KEY, SERVICE_ROLE_KEY).
#
# These are the local demo keys — they only grant access to the disposable,
# loopback-only local database. Never put PRODUCTION keys here: the test harness
# and seed scripts refuse any non-loopback Supabase host.
#
# Without these keys, integration tests skip under the existing CI policy
# (ALLOW_INTEGRATION_TEST_SKIP / _env-guard.test.ts) — they never fall back to
# production.
NEXT_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_URL=http://127.0.0.1:54331
NEXT_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY=<local anon key from `npx supabase status`>
SUPABASE_SERVICE_ROLE_KEY=<local service_role key from `npx supabase status`>
